P Academy is now complete. You have taken the first step on your musical journey with us, and we are delighted to have you on board. Get ready for an incredible musical adventure filled with learning, creativity, and fun.</p><br><p>Find below, your Username and Password:<br><br>Username: student<br>Password: password</p><br><p>Let\'s make beautiful music together!</p><br><p>Musically yours,<br>Team SVP</p></b><div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a></div>\n\n<div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a></div></p>\r\n                                                                                        </div>\r\n                                                                                    </div>\r\n                                                                                </td>\r\n                                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                                    </table>\r\n                                                                </td>\r\n                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                            <!-- END MAIN CONTENT AREA -->\r\n                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                    </table>\r\n\r\n                                                    <!-- SOCIAL LINKS -->\r\n                                                    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\r\n                                                        <tbody>\r\n                                                            <tr>\r\n                                                                <td class=\"content-block\" style=\"text-align: center;width: 100%;\">\r\n                                                       