(25, 'srigubri@gmail.com', 'hr@thesvpacademy.com', 'Schedule Class', '<section class=\"content\">\r\n    <div class=\"container-fluid\">\r\n        <div class=\"row\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n                <!-- For Messages -->\r\n                <div class=\"template-alert-block\"></div>\r\n                <div class=\"card card-primary\">\r\n                    <div class=\"card-header\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"card-title font-weight-bold\">\r\n                            <i class=\'fa fa-plus-square\'></i>&nbsp; </i>                        </h3>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"card-body append_place\">\r\n                        <div class=\"row\">\r\n                            <div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n                                <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"body\">\r\n                                    <tbody>\r\n                                        <tr>\r\n                                            <td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n                                            <td class=\"container\">\r\n                                                <div class=\"content\">\r\n                                                    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"body\">\r\n                                                        <tbody>\r\n                                                            <tr>\r\n                                                                <td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n                                                                    <div style=\"height: 70px;width:100%;text-align: center;margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n                                                                        <a href=\"https://thesvpacademy.com/admin/\">\r\n                                                                        </a>\r\n                                                                    </div>\r\n                                                                </td>\r\n                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                    </table> <!-- START CENTERED WHITE CONTAINER -->\r\n\r\n                                                    <table role=\"presentation\" class=\"main\">\r\n                                                        <!-- START MAIN CONTENT AREA -->\r\n                                                        <tbody>\r\n                                                            <tr>\r\n                                                                <td class=\"wrapper\">\r\n                                                                    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n                                                                        <tbody>\r\n                                                                            <tr>\r\n                                                                                <td>\r\n                                                                                    <h1 style=\"text-decoration: none; font-size: 24px;line-height: 28px;font-weight: bold\"></h1>\r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"mailcontent\" style=\"line-height: 26px;font-size: 14px;\">\r\n                                                                                        <div class=\"mailcontent\" style=\"line-height: 26px;font-size: 14px;\">\r\n                                                                                            <p><span>\n\n<b><p></p></b></span><b><p>Dear Kaadambari  Anand,</p><br><p>Greetings from SVP Academy, where Passion meets Practice!</p><br><p>We at SVP Academy are thrilled to collaborate with you on your musical journey. It fills us with pride to welcome you as a part of our family. While the virtual setting may seem distant, we are dedicated to recreating the essence of a \'Gurukul\' and sharing our musical knowledge with you.</p><br><p>Your esteemed Mentor/Guru, Brinda  Radhakrishnan will guide you in your musical endeavors, and SVP Academy will be your musical home from this moment forward.</p><br><p>For all communication related to our classes, please use the email address operations@thesvpacademy.com. This will be your primary source for updates, musical insights, and interesting facts about music, both vocal and instrumental. Be sure to save this email address in your address book to stay connected with us.</p><br><p>Below, you will find the details of your class schedule:</p><br><p>https://meet.google.com/gbb-tuef-nau</p><p>Your classes are scheduled on [\n\nSaturday\n\n of the Week] at 17 February 2024, 07:15 AM IST every week.</p><br><p>If you encounter any issues or have questions, please do not hesitate to reach out to us.</p><br><p>Thank you for entrusting us with your musical education. We look forward to a harmonious journey together.</p><br><p>Musically yours,<br>Team SVP</p></b><br><span><b>\n\n<br><p></p></b></span></p>\r\n                                                                                        </div>\r\n                                                                                    </div>\r\n                                                                                </td>\r\n                                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                                    </table>\r\n                                                                </td>\r\n                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                            <!-- END MAIN CONTENT AREA -->\r\n                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                    </table>\r\n\r\n                                                    <!-- SOCIAL LINKS -->\r\n                                                    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\r\n                                                        <tbody>\r\n                                                            <tr>\r\n                                                                <td class=\"content-block\" style=\"text-align: center;width: 100%;\">\r\n                                                                                                                                    </td>\r\n                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                    </table>\r\n\r\n                                                    <!-- START FOOTER -->\r\n                                                    <div class=\"footer\">\r\n                                                        <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n                                                            <tbody>\r\n                                                                <tr>\r\n                                                                    <td class=\"content-block powered-by\">\r\n\r\n                                                                    </td>\r\n                                                                </tr>\r\n\r\n                                                            </tbody>\r\n                                                        </table>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                    <!-- END FOOTER -->\r\n\r\n                                                    <!-- END CENTERED WHITE CONTAINER -->\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                            </td>\r\n                                            <td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n                                        </tr>\r\n                                    </tbody>\r\n                                </table>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</section>', 0, '2024-02-16 13:16:25', '2024-02-16 13:17:03', 3, 1),
(26, 'srigubri@gmail.com', 'hr@thesvpacademy.com', 'Your Ticket Update', '<section class=\"content\">\r\n    <div class=\"container-fluid\">\r\n        <div class=\"row\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n                <!-- For Messages -->\r\n                <div class=\"template-alert-block\"></div>\r\n                <div class=\"card card-primary\">\r\n                    <div class=\"card-header\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"card-title font-weight-bold\">\r\n                            <i class=\'fa fa-plus-square\'></i>&nbsp; </i>                        </h3>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"card-body append_place\">\r\n                        <div class=\"row\">\r\n                            <div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n                                <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"body\">\r\n                                    <tbody>\r\n                                        <tr>\r\n                                            <td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n                                            <td class=\"container\">\r\n                                                <div class=\"content\">\r\n                                                    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"body\">\r\n                                                        <tbody>\r\n                                                            <tr>\r\n                                                                <td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n                                                                    <div style=\"height: 70px;width:100%;text-align: center;margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n                                                                        <a href=\"https://thesvpacademy.com/admin/\">\r\n                                                                        </a>\r\n                                                                    </div>\r\n                                                                </td>\r\n                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                    </table> <!-- START CENTERED WHITE CONTAINER -->\r\n\r\n                                                    <table role=\"presentation\" class=\"main\">\r\n                                                        <!-- START MAIN CONTENT AREA -->\r\n                                                        <tbody>\r\n                                                            <tr>\r\n                                                                <td class=\"wrapper\">\r\n                                                                    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n                                                                        <tbody>\r\n                                                                            <tr>\r\n                                                                                <td>\r\n                                                                                    <h1 style=\"text-decoration: none; font-size: 24px;line-height: 28px;font-weight: bold\"></h1>\r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"mailcontent\" style=\"line-height: 26px;font-size: 14px;\">\r\n                                                                                        <div class=\"mailcontent\" style=\"line-height: 26px;font-size: 14px;\">\r\n                                                                                            <p>Dear Kaadambari  Anand&nbsp;\n\n,<div><br></div><div>Greetings from SVP Academy, where Passion meets Practice!</div><div><br></div><div>We hope this message finds you well. We wanted to provide you with an update on the ticket you recently raised with us.</div><div><br></div><div>Our dedicated support team is currently reviewing your request and working diligently to provide you with the best possible assistance. We understand the importance of a seamless experience, and we appreciate your patience as we address your concerns.</div><div><br></div><div>Should you have any additional information or details to share, please don\'t hesitate to email us at operations@thesvpacademy. Our goal is to ensure that your experience with SVP Academy remains harmonious and enjoyable.</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you for choosing SVP Academy. We are honored to be a part of your musical journey, and we\'re here to assist you every step of the way. </div><div><br></div><div>Musically Yours, </div><div><br></div><div>Team SVP</div></p>\r\n                                                                                        </div>\r\n                                                                                    </div>\r\n                                                                                </td>\r\n                                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                                    </table>\r\n                                                                </td>\r\n                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                            <!-- END MAIN CONTENT AREA -->\r\n                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                    </table>\r\n\r\n                                                    <!-- SOCIAL LINKS -->\r\n                                                    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\r\n                                                        <tbody>\r\n                                                            <tr>\r\n                                                                <td class=\"content-block\" style=\"text-align: center;width: 100%;\">\r\n                                                                                                                                    </td>\r\n                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                    </table>\r\n\r\n                                                    <!-- START FOOTER -->\r\n                                                    <div class=\"footer\">\r\n                                                        <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n                                                            <tbody>\r\n                                                                <tr>\r\n                                                                    <td class=\"content-block powered-by\">\r\n\r\n                                                                    </td>\r\n                                                                </tr>\r\n\r\n                                                            </tbody>\r\n                                                        </table>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                    <!-- END FOOTER -->\r\n\r\n                                                    <!-- END CENTERED WHITE CONTAINER -->\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                            </td>\r\n                                            <td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n                                        </tr>\r\n                                    </tbody>\r\n                                </table>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</section>', 0, '2024-02-16 13:20:41', '2024-02-16 13:21:03', 3, 1),
(27, 'srigubri@gmail.com', 'hr@thesvpacademy.com', 'Class Rescheduling Notice', '<section class=\"content\">\r\n    <div class=\"container-fluid\">\r\n        <div class=\"row\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n                <!-- For Messages -->\r\n                <div class=\"template-alert-block\"></div>\r\n                <div class=\"card card-primary\">\r\n                    <div class=\"card-header\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"card-title font-weight-bold\">\r\n                            <i class=\'fa fa-plus-square\'></i>&nbsp; </i>                        </h3>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"card-body append_place\">\r\n                        <div class=\"row\">\r\n                            <div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n                                <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"body\">\r\n                                    <tbody>\r\n                                        <tr>\r\n                                            <td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n                                            <td class=\"container\">\r\n                                                <div class=\"content\">\r\n                                                    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"body\">\r\n                                                        <tbody>\r\n                                                            <tr>\r\n                                                                <td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n                                                                    <div style=\"height: 70px;width:100%;text-align: center;margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n                                                                        <a href=\"https://thesvpacademy.com/admin/\">\r\n                                                                        </a>\r\n                                                                    </div>\r\n                                                                </td>\r\n                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                    </table> <!-- START CENTERED WHITE CONTAINER -->\r\n\r\n                                                    <table role=\"presentation\" class=\"main\">\r\n                                                        <!-- START MAIN CONTENT AREA -->\r\n                                                        <tbody>\r\n                                                            <tr>\r\n                                                                <td class=\"wrapper\">\r\n                                                                    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n                                                                        <tbody>\r\n                                                                            <tr>\r\n                                                                                <td>\r\n                                                                                    <h1 style=\"text-decoration: none; font-size: 24px;line-height: 28px;font-weight: bold\"></h1>\r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"mailcontent\" style=\"line-height: 26px;font-size: 14px;\">\r\n                                                                                        <div class=\"mailcontent\" style=\"line-height: 26px;font-size: 14px;\">\r\n                                                                                            <p><b><p>Dear Kaadambari  Anand,</p><br><p>Greetings from SVP Academy, where Passion meets Practice!</p><br><p>We hope this message finds you well. We wanted to inform you of an upcoming change to your class schedule in the VCB 1 batch. Here are the class details:</p><br><p>Teacher: Brinda  Radhakrishnan</p><p>Original Class Date: 17 February 2024, Saturday</p><p>Original Class Time: 07:15 AM</p><p>Rescheduled Class Date: 17 February 2024, Saturday</p><p>Rescheduled Class Time: 07:45 AM</p><p>Reason for Rescheduling: not well</p><br><p>We want to take a moment to emphasize how dedicated our teachers at SVP Academy are to your musical education. They are committed to your growth and learning experience. Occasionally, unforeseen circumstances may necessitate rescheduling, and we assure you that such changes are made with your educational progress in mind. Your teacher\'s commitment to providing you with the best possible instruction remains unwavering.</p><br><p>We understand that changes in the schedule can be inconvenient, and we appreciate your flexibility and understanding in this matter. If you have any questions or concerns regarding this rescheduling, please do not hesitate to reach out to us.</p><br><p>Thank you for your commitment to your musical education at SVP Academy. We look forward to your continued growth and success.</p><br><p>Musically yours,</p><p>Team SVP</p><br></b></p>\r\n                                                                                        </div>\r\n                                                                                    </div>\r\n                                                                                </td>\r\n                                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                                    </table>\r\n                                                                </td>\r\n                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                            <!-- END MAIN CONTENT AREA -->\r\n                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                    </table>\r\n\r\n                                                    <!-- SOCIAL LINKS -->\r\n                                                    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\r\n                                                        <tbody>\r\n                                                            <tr>\r\n                                                                <td class=\"content-block\" style=\"text-align: center;width: 100%;\">\r\n                                                                                                                                    </td>\r\n                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                    </table>\r\n\r\n                                                    <!-- START FOOTER -->\r\n                                                    <div class=\"footer\">\r\n                                                        <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n                                                            <tbody>\r\n                                                                <tr>\r\n                                                                    <td class=\"content-block powered-by\">\r\n\r\n                                                                    </td>\r\n                                                                </tr>\r\n\r\n                                                            </tbody>\r\n                                                        </table>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                    <!-- END FOOTER -->\r\n\r\n                                                    <!-- END CENTERED WHITE CONTAINER -->\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                            </td>\r\n                                            <td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n                                        </tr>\r\n                                    </tbody>\r\n                                </table>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</section>', 0, '2024-02-16 13:41:41', '2024-02-16 13:42:02', 3, 1),
