(48, 'srigubri@gmail.com', 'hr@thesvpacademy.com', 'Class Rescheduling Notice', '<section class=\"content\">\r\n    <div class=\"container-fluid\">\r\n        <div class=\"row\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n                <!-- For Messages -->\r\n                <div class=\"template-alert-block\"></div>\r\n                <div class=\"card card-primary\">\r\n                    <div class=\"card-header\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"card-title font-weight-bold\">\r\n                            <i class=\'fa fa-plus-square\'></i>&nbsp; </i>                        </h3>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"card-body append_place\">\r\n                        <div class=\"row\">\r\n                            <div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n                                <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"body\">\r\n                                    <tbody>\r\n                                        <tr>\r\n                                            <td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n                                            <td class=\"container\">\r\n                                                <div class=\"content\">\r\n                                                    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"body\">\r\n                                                        <tbody>\r\n                                                            <tr>\r\n                                                                <td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n                                                                    <div style=\"height: 70px;width:100%;text-align: center;margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n                                                                        <a href=\"https://thesvpacademy.com/admin/\">\r\n                                                                        </a>\r\n                                                                    </div>\r\n                                                                </td>\r\n                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                    </table> <!-- START CENTERED WHITE CONTAINER -->\r\n\r\n                                                    <table role=\"presentation\" class=\"main\">\r\n                                                        <!-- START MAIN CONTENT AREA -->\r\n                                                        <tbody>\r\n                                                            <tr>\r\n                                                                <td class=\"wrapper\">\r\n                                                                    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n                                                                        <tbody>\r\n                                                                            <tr>\r\n                                                                                <td>\r\n                                                                                    <h1 style=\"text-decoration: none; font-size: 24px;line-height: 28px;font-weight: bold\"></h1>\r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"mailcontent\" style=\"line-height: 26px;font-size: 14px;\">\r\n                                                                                        <div class=\"mailcontent\" style=\"line-height: 26px;font-size: 14px;\">\r\n                                                                                            <p><b><p>Dear Kaadambari  Anand,</p><br><p>Greetings from SVP Academy, where Passion meets Practice!</p><br><p>We hope this message finds you well. We wanted to inform you of an upcoming change to your class schedule in the VCI 1 batch. Here are the class details:</p><br><p>Teacher: Brinda  Radhakrishnan</p><p>Original Class Date: 26 February 2024, Monday</p><p>Original Class Time: 06:30 AM</p><p>Rescheduled Class Date: 04 March 2024, Monday</p><p>Rescheduled Class Time: 06:30 AM</p><p>Reason for Rescheduling: gdsgfdgdfgf</p><br><p>We want to take a moment to emphasize how dedicated our teachers at SVP Academy are to your musical education. They are committed to your growth and learning experience. Occasionally, unforeseen circumstances may necessitate rescheduling, and we assure you that such changes are made with your educational progress in mind. Your teacher\'s commitment to providing you with the best possible instruction remains unwavering.</p><br><p>We understand that changes in the schedule can be inconvenient, and we appreciate your flexibility and understanding in this matter. If you have any questions or concerns regarding this rescheduling, please do not hesitate to reach out to us.</p><br><p>Thank you for your commitment to your musical education at SVP Academy. We look forward to your continued growth and success.</p><br><p>Musically yours,</p><p>Team SVP</p><br></b></p>\r\n                                                                                        </div>\r\n                                                                                    </div>\r\n                                                                                </td>\r\n                                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                                    </table>\r\n                                                                </td>\r\n                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                            <!-- END MAIN CONTENT AREA -->\r\n                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                    </table>\r\n\r\n                                                    <!-- SOCIAL LINKS -->\r\n                                                    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\r\n                                                        <tbody>\r\n                                                            <tr>\r\n                                                                <td class=\"content-block\" style=\"text-align: center;width: 100%;\">\r\n                                                                                                                                    </td>\r\n                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                    </table>\r\n\r\n                                                    <!-- START FOOTER -->\r\n                                                    <div class=\"footer\">\r\n                                                        <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n                                                            <tbody>\r\n                                                                <tr>\r\n                                                                    <td class=\"content-block powered-by\">\r\n\r\n                                                                    </td>\r\n                                                                </tr>\r\n\r\n                                                            </tbody>\r\n                                                        </table>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                    <!-- END FOOTER -->\r\n\r\n                                                    <!-- END CENTERED WHITE CONTAINER -->\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                            </td>\r\n                                            <td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n                                        </tr>\r\n                                    </tbody>\r\n                                </table>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</section>', 0, '2024-02-19 10:25:08', '2024-02-19 10:26:02', 1, 1),
