rney. It fills us with pride to welcome you as a part of our family. While the virtual setting may seem distant, we are dedicated to recreating the essence of a \'Gurukul\' and sharing our musical knowledge with you.</p><br><p>Your esteemed Mentor/Guru, Brinda  Radhakrishnan will guide you in your musical endeavors, and SVP Academy will be your musical home from this moment forward.</p><br><p>For all communication related to our classes, please use the email address operations@thesvpacademy.com. This will be your primary source for updates, musical insights, and interesting facts about music, both vocal and instrumental. Be sure to save this email address in your address book to stay connected with us.</p><br><p>Below, you will find the details of your class schedule:</p><br><p>WWW.youtube.com</p><p>Your classes are scheduled on [\n\nWednesday\n\n of the Week] at 21 February 2024, 07:30 AM IST every week.</p><br><p>If you encounter any issues or have questions, please do not hesitate to reach out to us.</p><br><p>Thank you for entrusting us with your musical education. We look forward to a harmonious journey together.</p><br><p>Musically yours,<br>Team SVP</p></b><br><span><b>\n\n<br><p></p></b></span></p>\r\n                                                                                        </div>\r\n                                                                                    </div>\r\n                                                                                </td>\r\n                                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                                    </table>\r\n                                                                </td>\r\n                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                            <!-- END MAIN CONTENT AREA -->\r\n                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                    </table>\r\n\r\n                                                    <!-- SOCIAL LINKS -->\r\n                                                    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\r\n                                                        <tbody>\r\n                                                            <tr>\r\n                                                                <td class=\"content-block\" style=\"text-align: center;width: 100%;\">\r\n                                                                                                                                    </td>\r\n                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                    </table>\r\n\r\n                                                    <!-- START FOOTER -->\r\n                                                    <div class=\"footer\">\r\n                                                        <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n                                                            <tbody>\r\n                                                                <tr>\r\n                                                                    <td class=\"content-block powered-by\">\r\n\r\n                                                                    </td>\r\n                                                                </tr>\r\n\r\n                                                            </tbody>\r\n                                                        </table>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                    <!-- END FOOTER -->\r\n\r\n                                                    <!-- END CENTERED WHITE CONTAINER -->\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                            </td>\r\n                                            <td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n                                        </tr>\r\n                                    </tbody>\r\n                                </table>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</section>', 0, '2024-02-19 10:55:56', '2024-02-19 10:56:06', 3, 1);
