<br></div><div>Date: 26 Feb 2024,\n\nMonday\n\n</div><div>Time: 06:30: AM</div><div>Student: Akshaya  V</div><div>Batch Name: VCB1</div><div><br></div><div>Prepare yourself for a fantastic session. Please ensure you have your instrument, notes, and a positive attitude ready!</div><div><br></div><div>Please make sure you are well-prepared to inspire and educate our talented students.</div><div><br></div><div>If you are unable to attend, kindly inform us in advance.</div><div><br></div><div>We look forward to another wonderful class!</div><div><br></div><div> Musically yours,</div><div> Team SVP</div></p>\r\n                                                                                        </div>\r\n                                                                                    </div>\r\n                                                                                </td>\r\n                                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                                    </table>\r\n                                                                </td>\r\n                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                            <!-- END MAIN CONTENT AREA -->\r\n                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                    </table>\r\n\r\n                                                    <!-- SOCIAL LINKS -->\r\n                                                    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\r\n                                                        <tbody>\r\n                                                            <tr>\r\n                                                                <td class=\"content-block\" style=\"text-align: center;width: 100%;\">\r\n                                                                                                                                    </td>\r\n                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                    </table>\r\n\r\n                                                    <!-- START FOOTER -->\r\n                                                    <div class=\"footer\">\r\n                                                        <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n                                                            <tbody>\r\n                                                                <tr>\r\n                                                                    <td class=\"content-block powered-by\">\r\n\r\n                                                                    </td>\r\n                                                                </tr>\r\n\r\n                                                            </tbody>\r\n                                                        </table>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                    <!-- END FOOTER -->\r\n\r\n                                                    <!-- END CENTERED WHITE CONTAINER -->\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                            </td>\r\n                                            <td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n                                        </tr>\r\n                                    </tbody>\r\n                                </table>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</section>', 0, '2024-02-25 01:00:03', '2024-02-25