date on the ticket you recently raised with us.</div><div><br></div><div>Our dedicated support team is currently reviewing your request and working diligently to provide you with the best possible assistance. We understand the importance of a seamless experience, and we appreciate your patience as we address your concerns.</div><div><br></div><div>Should you have any additional information or details to share, please don\'t hesitate to email us at operations@thesvpacademy. Our goal is to ensure that your experience with SVP Academy remains harmonious and enjoyable.</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you for choosing SVP Academy. We are honored to be a part of your musical journey, and we\'re here to assist you every step of the way. </div><div><br></div><div>Musically Yours, </div><div><br></div><div>Team SVP</div></p>\r\n                                                                                        </div>\r\n                                                                                    </div>\r\n                                                                                </td>\r\n                                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                                    </table>\r\n                                                                </td>\r\n                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                            <!-- END MAIN CONTENT AREA -->\r\n                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                    </table>\r\n\r\n                                                    <!-- SOCIAL LINKS -->\r\n                                                    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\r\n                                                        <tbody>\r\n                                                            <tr>\r\n                                                                <td class=\"content-block\" style=\"text-align: center;width: 100%;\">\r\n                                                                                                                                    </td>\r\n                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                    </table>\r\n\r\n                                                    <!-- START FOOTER -->\r\n                                                    <div class=\"footer\">\r\n                                                        <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n                                                            <tbody>\r\n                                                                <tr>\r\n                                                                    <td class=\"content-block powered-by\">\r\n\r\n                                                                    </td>\r\n                                                                </tr>\r\n\r\n                                                            </tbody>\r\n                                                        </table>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                    <!-- END FOOTER -->\r\n\r\n                                                    <!-- END CENTERED WHITE CONTAINER -->\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                            </td>\r\n                                            <td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n                                        </tr>\r\n                                    </tbody>\r\n                                </table>\r\n                