                                                                </div>\r\n                                                                </td>\r\n                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                    </table> <!-- START CENTERED WHITE CONTAINER -->\r\n\r\n                                                    <table role=\"presentation\" class=\"main\">\r\n                                                        <!-- START MAIN CONTENT AREA -->\r\n                                                        <tbody>\r\n                                                            <tr>\r\n                                                                <td class=\"wrapper\">\r\n                                                                    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n                                                                        <tbody>\r\n                                                                            <tr>\r\n                                                                                <td>\r\n                                                                                    <h1 style=\"text-decoration: none; font-size: 24px;line-height: 28px;font-weight: bold\"></h1>\r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"mailcontent\" style=\"line-height: 26px;font-size: 14px;\">\r\n                                                                                        <div class=\"mailcontent\" style=\"line-height: 26px;font-size: 14px;\">\r\n                                                                                            <p>Dear Arpita  Pal,<div><br></div><div>Greetings from SVP Academy, where Passion meets Practice!</div><div><br></div><div>This is a friendly reminder of your upcoming music class scheduled in just 3 hours.</div><div><br></div><div>Class Details: </div><div><br></div><div>Date: 07 Mar 2024\n\n, \n\nThursday</div><div>Time: 11:00: AM</div><div>Teacher: Brinda  Radhakrishnan</div><div>Course Name: Vocals Carnatic</div><div>Batch Name:\n\nVCB1</div><div><br></div><div>Prepare yourself for a fantastic session. Please ensure you have your instrument(s), notes, and a positive attitude ready!</div><div><br></div><div>If you are unable to attend, kindly inform us in advance.</div><div><br></div><div>We look forward to another wonderful class!</div><div><br></div><div> Musically yours,</div><div> Team SVP</div></p>\r\n                                                                                        </div>\r\n                                                                                    </div>\r\n                                                                                </td>\r\n                                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                                    </table>\r\n                                                                </td>\r\n                                                            </tr>\r\n                                                            <!-- END MAIN CONTENT AREA -->\r\n                                                        </tbody>\r\n                                                    </table>\r\n\r\n                                                    <!-- SOCIAL LINKS -->\r\n                                                    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\r\n                                                        <tbody>\r\n                                                            <tr>\r\n                                                                <td class=\"content-block\"